From 23b5ef34127aceabc5b7408a96394d6cc4e6a7c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pauleveritt <pauleveritt@me.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 07:29:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] mellum: tokenizer, chat and thinking

The mellum2 pre-tokenizer and its generated Unicode classes, the corpus
markers classed as content, <think> and </think> as the reasoning boundary, the
special-token and stop classes, its own system turn and assistant prefix, one
user turn per assistant turn's tool results, the CLI's matching system prompt
and speed line, and imported history that drops earlier reasoning.

Upstream: not offered, fork only
Retire-when: upstream renders and stops Mellum 2.1 chats
